    "verdict": "passes: a throw can be seen, the rod stays in every frame, same figure, the seat level does not rise. Surprising: from frame 2 the legs spread into a wide planted squat instead of dangling, and the rod goes horizontal in both hands in 3-6",
    "best_frames": "frames 3-6 read as the throw: 3 the free hand swings back left with the object, 4 the arm fully out to the left, 5 the object in the air at the far left and the hand coming back, 6 the hand on the rod again (frames 1-2 are the grip shift)",
